  "details": "Request for change.\n\nQuest finger/hand tracking sounds.\n\nEvery time you move, click ,or jump with hand tracking it makes constant noise.\n\nThe noises it makes can get annoying, and the only way I've found to make the sounds mute is to turn down UI/Menu volume.\n\nIt sucks having to turn off my menu sounds to use hand tracking.\n\nI don't get why it was tied to that volume slider.\n\nI think is should be able to be disabled independently from the menu audio.\n\nYou wouldn't want noises played when you move your joystick or press a button on your controller/keyboard, why have it that way for hand tracking.\n\nIt doesn't make sense.\n\nSo I think it should be changed to a different audio toggle.\n\n(Maybe a sound toggle under hand tracking settings?)\n\nNot many people use hand tracking on quest so I get why this may have not been noticed (I've only seen one other person in this server say anything about it.)\n\nAs someone who has used hand tracking every day for three years its the only problem I have with it.",
